 "commit": {
  "author": "Azzinoth",
  "date": "2026-11-28T02:14:47Z",
  "message": "Updated FESceneGraphUI submodule to the latest version; After game mode is stopped, the scene it was started from is focused again and its tab is brought to front, previously no scene was focused and Scene Graph window was empty until a scene tab was clicked; If window of that scene was closed during game mode, the first opened scene window is focused; Closing game mode scene window now stops game mode, previously only the window was removed while the game mode scene kept running and the editor stayed in game mode; Game mode can now be stopped when no scene is focused; Added FEEditorSceneWindowManager::FocusSceneWindow; Components in more places now have colors: icons of Add Component menu, component icons in scene graph rows and a line at the left edge of inspector headers use color of their component; Filter buttons of content browser now have icons in color of their type, selected button has outline and tint of that color, previously icons were white and selected button was filled with accent color; Colors of resource types and of components are now given only by FEEditorStyle::GetTypeColor and GetComponentColor, previously the type color function was private to content browser; Added FEEditorStyle::Mix; Fixed 'Spawn' and 'Instance' groups of instanced component, closing them did not hide their rows; Fixed conflicting ID of 'Convert to 3D texture' group and button in texture window.",
  "url": "https://github.com/Azzinoth/FocalEngineEditor/commit/e133d4cc59f6a1b74f247c31e1fd544bec636563"
 },
